 "honest": [
  "the wide book is every eligible member at equal weight, so the ladder's five legs are a rounding error in it by construction; the beta therefore cannot come from holding them, and the residual-bucket regression is the direct measurement of where it does",
  "holdings are read with the engine's own ranking function on the engine's own rank cache at each decision index, so the composition rows and the simulated curve cannot disagree about which names were eligible",
  "the residual bucket re-ranks in its own universe, so it is a clean equal-weight read of non-ladder members, not a subtraction of two curves",
  "the tilt regressor is the four-member skin (E43 reach-back) wherever the five-member skin cannot be priced; both are reported in the E43 history face",
  "descriptive census only: no gate, no verdict, no prereg, no trial count"
 ]
